<title>HONG KONG: BZW sets call warrants on HK&amp;S Hotels.</title>
<headline>BZW sets call warrants on HK&amp;S Hotels.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Warrants Ltd said in a statement it launched 180 million American-style call warrants on shares of Hongkong and Shanghai Hotels Ltd on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$11.2	PREMIUM	 6.64 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.389     GEARING	 3.64X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  09.OCT.97    PAYDATE	 24.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG    MIN EXER LOT  5,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$14.15</p>
<p> NOTE		  EXPECTED LISTING DATE  31.OCT.96</p>
<p>			 MAX EXER LOT  15,000,000</p>
<p>			 PHYSICAL DELIVERY OR CASH AT ISSUER'S OPTION</p>
<p>			 CLEARING IN HONG KONG</p>
<p>			 PRIMARY MARKET     HONG KONG/LONDON</p>
<p>			 SECONDARY MARKET   HONG KONG</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
